    "data": {
      "id": 1462,
      "hub_id": 2019,
      "guid": null,
      "name": "Immersive Daylight Cycle",
      "slug": "immersive-daylight-cycle",
      "teaser": "Immersive, Semi-Hardcore Time System!\r\n-Time is paused when out of raid\r\n-Only one time available when entering a raid based on what time it was when you left your last raid\r\n-Configurable daylight cycle rate and more!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2019.jpg",
      "downloads": 6757,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod does the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pauses in-game time when out of raid</li>\n<li>Slows down the daylight cycle in raid from 7x IRL speed to 5x. (configurable)</li>\n<li>Stores a current out of raid time based on when you left your last raid (can be changed manually in the config)</li>\n<li>When you exit a raid, the current in-game time + a time jump of 1 hour (configurable) will be saved and used when you enter the next raid</li>\n<li>When you die, the time will reset to 8 am (configurable)</li>\n<li>Factory will be locked to day or night depending on the current saved time\n<ul>\n<li>Night time for Factory starts at 21:00 and ends at 06:00</li>\n<li>You can disable the time system specifically for Factory in the config if you’d rather still be able to choose the time on that map</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NOTE: This mod will NOT affect hideout craft times or trader restocks. You will need to adjust the server-side time rate via SVM or similar to change that.</p>\n<p><strong>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/jehree\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee!</a></strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Click the big blue <strong>DOWNLOAD</strong> button in the top right</li>\n<li>Select the correct version</li>\n<li>Drag contents of the zip into the folder you installed SPT to:</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>MASSIVE</strong> thanks to the many awesome people who helped me both with this mod, as well as with learning how to make client mods in general!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/30839-drakiaxyz/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DrakiaXYZ</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/37201-dirtbikercj/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cj</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/51211-lacyway/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lacyway</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/16882-arys/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arys</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/12898-cwx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/50720-mpstark/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mpstark</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/49246-tyfon/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tyfon</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/40264-djlang/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DJ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>…and probably more. Yell at me if I missed you!</p></div></div></div>\n",
